### What I learned
     - Clickhouse uses Google test framework(gtest) for UT. Each component folder in /src has its own tests/ subfolder containing gtest_*.cpp files. If i want to do testing under s specific component i have to create a file in /src/component/tests/gtest_functionality_name.cpp

     - Functional testing : Clickhouse/test/queries/stateless_0/000_functionality_name.sql
                            Clickhouse/test/queries/stateless_0/000_functionality_name.reference
                            How it works:
                                .sql = Test queries
                                .reference = Expected output
                                1) Test runner compares actual output vs reference
                                2) Match = PASS, Differ = FAIL

                            command : ./tests/clickhouse-test 000_functionality_name
        
